[
    {
        "content": "<p>I am working to understand Symantics and Denotational semantics through the lecture notes: Typed Tagless Final Interpreters by Oleg Kiselyov (<a href=\"https://okmij.org/ftp/tagless-final/course/lecture.pdf\">https://okmij.org/ftp/tagless-final/course/lecture.pdf</a>).<br>\nDuring chapter three he introduces the following haskell Variable type:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Haskell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kr\">data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kr\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">VZ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">VS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Which I translated to the universe polymorphic lean inductive type:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vz</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I ran this on the latest playground v4.34.0-r2 and got the following message on the vz line:<br>\nstuck at solving universe constraint<br>\n<code>u =?= max v ?u.9</code><br>\nwhile trying to unify<br>\n<code>Type u : Type (u + 1)</code><br>\nwith<br>\n<code>Type (max v ?u.9) : Type (max (v + 1) (?u.9 + 1))</code></p>\n<p>Which I do not understand, as I would expect <code>Type (max (v + 1) (?u.9 + 1))</code> to unify with <code>Type ((max v ?u.9) + 1)</code>.<br>\nHow do I resolve this? And is this a bug/oversight in the unification algorithm?</p>",
        "id": 619253764,
        "sender_full_name": "Mikkel Kirkegaard",
        "timestamp": 1787741657
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You should declare the types of your variables explicitly. As in, write </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vz</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">???</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">???</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">???</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">???</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">???</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>(fill in the <code>???</code>)</p>",
