    {
        "content": "<p>No, it's totally right to complain here! In <code>vz</code>, the first argument is supposed to be <code>Type u</code> and you specify it as <code>α × env</code>; the second argument is supposed to be <code>Type v</code> and you specify it as <code>α</code>.<br>\nSo alright, <code>α : Type v</code> is obvious but how do we get <code>α × env : Type u</code>? We don't! Consider <code>u = 1</code> and <code>v = 2</code>. Then regardless of what universe <code>env</code> is in, <code>α × env</code> is <em>at least</em> in <code>Type 2</code> but we require <code>Type 1</code> which would be too small.<br>\nSo you were probably a bit overeager with universe polymorphism; just this works fine:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vz</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 619285346,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1787751047
    },
